{"seq":1,"slug":"soundstage","title":"声场三维构建与空间定位","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/mixing-engineering/mix-aesthetics/soundstage","wordCount":1833,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"声场三维构建与空间定位\">声场三维构建与空间定位</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>声场构建是在二维回放介质（立体声双扬声器）上创造三维空间幻觉的艺术，其三个维度——宽度、深度、高度——各有对应的技术手段：宽度靠 Pan 与 M/S 处理，深度靠混响、电平与高频衰减，高度则是频率-空间映射的利用。理解声场的关键在于知道每个维度用哪些工具、以及它们如何互相牵制（例如展宽常牺牲单声道兼容性）。本篇按维度逐一展开，并给出声场参考检查清单。</p>\n<h2 id=\"混音空间的三个维度\">混音空间的三个维度</h2><p>混音的声场构建是在二维回放介质（立体声双扬声器）上创造三维空间幻觉的艺术。这三个维度各有对应的技术手段：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>声场</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>宽度</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>深度</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>高度</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{声场} = f(\\text{宽度}, \\text{深度}, \\text{高度})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">声场</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">宽度</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">深度</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">高度</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>感知</th>\n<th>控制手段</th>\n<th>范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>宽度（Width）</td>\n<td>左右展开</td>\n<td>Pan、立体声宽度</td>\n<td>L–C–R</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深度（Depth）</td>\n<td>前后距离</td>\n<td>混响、电平、EQ</td>\n<td>近–远</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高度（Height）</td>\n<td>频率分层</td>\n<td>频率分布</td>\n<td>低–高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>严格来说，&quot;高度&quot;不是真正的垂直空间维度（立体声系统无法再现仰角），但人类听觉系统倾向于将高频元素感知为&quot;在上方&quot;，低频元素感知为&quot;在下方&quot;——这种频率-空间映射可以被混音师利用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph 宽度[&quot;宽度 Width&quot;]&#10;        W1[&quot;Pan 声像定位&quot;]&#10;        W2[&quot;立体声展宽&quot;]&#10;        W3[&quot;M/S 处理&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 深度[&quot;深度 Depth&quot;]&#10;        D1[&quot;混响量 大小&quot;]&#10;        D2[&quot;电平 远近&quot;]&#10;        D3[&quot;高频衰减&quot;]&#10;        D4[&quot;早期反射&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 高度[&quot;高度 Height&quot;]&#10;        H1[&quot;频率分布&quot;]&#10;        H2[&quot;泛音结构&quot;]&#10;        H3[&quot;EQ 倾向&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph 宽度[\"宽度 Width\"]\n        W1[\"Pan 声像定位\"]\n        W2[\"立体声展宽\"]\n        W3[\"M/S 处理\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 深度[\"深度 Depth\"]\n        D1[\"混响量 大小\"]\n        D2[\"电平 远近\"]\n        D3[\"高频衰减\"]\n        D4[\"早期反射\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 高度[\"高度 Height\"]\n        H1[\"频率分布\"]\n        H2[\"泛音结构\"]\n        H3[\"EQ 倾向\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"宽度控制技术\">宽度控制技术</h2><p>声像定位（Panning）是宽度控制的基础。但仅仅将乐器分配到不同的 Pan 位置是不够的——还需要考虑频率遮蔽在空间维度上的影响。</p>\n<p>混音布局策略：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>位置</th>\n<th>适合的元素</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n<th>注意事项</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>正中 (C)</td>\n<td>Kick, Bass, Vocal, Snare</td>\n<td>能量锚定</td>\n<td>避免拥挤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>略偏 (L15/R15)</td>\n<td>吉他、键盘</td>\n<td>保留中央空间</td>\n<td>互相对称</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中偏 (L30–50/R30–50)</td>\n<td>伴奏乐器</td>\n<td>填充空间</td>\n<td>平衡左右</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>极侧 (L80–100/R80–100)</td>\n<td>Room Mic, Wide Synth</td>\n<td>空间包裹</td>\n<td>不放重要元素</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>立体声宽度增强技术：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>M/S 编码:</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{M/S 编码:} \\quad M = \\frac{L+R}{2}, \\quad S = \\frac{L-R}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">M/S </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">编码</span><span class=\"mord\">:</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>增宽:</mtext><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msup><mi>L</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msup><mi>R</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>S</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{增宽:} \\quad L&#x27; = M + k \\cdot S, \\quad R&#x27; = M - k \\cdot S \\quad (k &gt; 1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">增宽</span><span class=\"mord\">:</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9963em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>宽度效果</th>\n<th>单声道兼容</th>\n<th>CPU</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>增加 S 增益</td>\n<td>中–强</td>\n<td>降低</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Haas 延迟 (1–20 ms)</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>频率分离 Pan</td>\n<td>自然宽</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>去相关混响</td>\n<td>扩散宽</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>微调失谐 (Detune)</td>\n<td>合唱宽</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>互补 EQ L/R</td>\n<td>轻微</td>\n<td>好</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>检验宽度的关键——单声道折叠测试：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Mono</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>M</mi><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>(S 分量完全消失)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Mono} = L + R = 2M \\quad \\text{(S 分量完全消失)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Mono</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(S </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">分量完全消失</span><span class=\"mord\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>所有仅存在于 S 通道的内容在单声道回放时消失。如果某乐器仅通过立体声展宽存在（无中央分量），它在单声道下会严重衰减。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;立体声信号&lt;br/&gt;L/R&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;M/S 编码&lt;br/&gt;M=(L+R)/2&lt;br/&gt;S=(L-R)/2&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;调整&lt;br/&gt;S 增益 x k&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;M/S 解码&lt;br/&gt;L&#39;=M+kS&lt;br/&gt;R&#39;=M-kS&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;更宽的立体声&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F[&quot;单声道检查&lt;br/&gt;L&#39;+R&#39;=2M&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"立体声信号&lt;br/&gt;L/R\"] --&gt; B[\"M/S 编码&lt;br/&gt;M=(L+R)/2&lt;br/&gt;S=(L-R)/2\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"调整&lt;br/&gt;S 增益 x k\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"M/S 解码&lt;br/&gt;L'=M+kS&lt;br/&gt;R'=M-kS\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"更宽的立体声\"]\n    D --&gt; F[\"单声道检查&lt;br/&gt;L'+R'=2M\"]</pre><h2 id=\"深度层次的创建\">深度层次的创建</h2><p>深度（前后距离感）是混音中最微妙也最强大的维度。在现实声学中，远处声源的特征包括：电平更低、高频衰减更多、直达声/混响比（D/R Ratio）更低、早期反射更模糊。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>距离感知线索:</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{距离感知线索:}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">距离感知线索</span><span class=\"mord\">:</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>线索</th>\n<th>物理原理</th>\n<th>混音对应操作</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>电平衰减</td>\n<td>距离平方反比</td>\n<td>降低推子</td>\n<td>最基础</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高频损失</td>\n<td>空气吸收</td>\n<td>LPF/High Shelf 切</td>\n<td>&quot;退后&quot;感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>D/R 比降低</td>\n<td>距离越远混响占比越大</td>\n<td>增加混响发送</td>\n<td>空间距离</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>早期反射</td>\n<td>室内几何</td>\n<td>Pre-delay 调整</td>\n<td>房间大小</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>瞬态软化</td>\n<td>空气/距离</td>\n<td>慢 Attack 压缩</td>\n<td>柔化边缘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>频谱密度</td>\n<td>距离模糊</td>\n<td>轻微饱和/带限</td>\n<td>自然远距离</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>距离与电平的物理关系：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>20</mn><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>10</mn></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mi>r</mi><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>dB</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L(r) = L_0 - 20\\log_{10}\\left(\\frac{r}{r_0}\\right) \\quad \\text{dB}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dB</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>距离翻倍，电平下降 6 dB。但在混音中直接应用此公式会导致后方元素太弱；实际操作更多依赖直觉和 D/R 比。</p>\n<p>Pre-delay（预延迟）是混响的关键参数——它模拟直达声与第一次反射之间的时间间隔：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Pre-delay</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi></mrow><mi>c</mi></mfrac><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>(d 为最近反射面距离)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Pre-delay} = \\frac{2d}{c} \\quad \\text{(d 为最近反射面距离)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Pre-delay</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0574em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3714em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(d </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">为最近反射面距离</span><span class=\"mord\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Pre-delay</th>\n<th>对应空间</th>\n<th>深度效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0–10 ms</td>\n<td>极小空间/紧贴墙壁</td>\n<td>模糊、后退</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>10–30 ms</td>\n<td>中等房间</td>\n<td>自然空间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>30–60 ms</td>\n<td>大厅</td>\n<td>明显空间感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>60–100 ms</td>\n<td>教堂/体育场</td>\n<td>极远距离</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph 前方[&quot;前方/近处&quot;]&#10;        F1[&quot;高电平&quot;]&#10;        F2[&quot;高频完整&quot;]&#10;        F3[&quot;干声为主&quot;]&#10;        F4[&quot;瞬态锋利&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 中间[&quot;中间距离&quot;]&#10;        M1[&quot;中等电平&quot;]&#10;        M2[&quot;轻微高频滚降&quot;]&#10;        M3[&quot;适度混响&quot;]&#10;        M4[&quot;瞬态稍柔&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 后方[&quot;后方/远处&quot;]&#10;        B1[&quot;低电平&quot;]&#10;        B2[&quot;显著高频衰减&quot;]&#10;        B3[&quot;混响主导&quot;]&#10;        B4[&quot;瞬态模糊&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph 前方[\"前方/近处\"]\n        F1[\"高电平\"]\n        F2[\"高频完整\"]\n        F3[\"干声为主\"]\n        F4[\"瞬态锋利\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 中间[\"中间距离\"]\n        M1[\"中等电平\"]\n        M2[\"轻微高频滚降\"]\n        M3[\"适度混响\"]\n        M4[\"瞬态稍柔\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 后方[\"后方/远处\"]\n        B1[\"低电平\"]\n        B2[\"显著高频衰减\"]\n        B3[\"混响主导\"]\n        B4[\"瞬态模糊\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"混响选择与空间设计\">混响选择与空间设计</h2><p>混响类型的选择直接定义了混音的空间&quot;性格&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>混响类型</th>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>密度</th>\n<th>尾音</th>\n<th>最佳用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Room</td>\n<td>短促、紧凑</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>0.2–0.6 s</td>\n<td>鼓/自然空间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Chamber</td>\n<td>温暖、中等</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>0.4–1.2 s</td>\n<td>人声/弦乐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Hall</td>\n<td>宽广、丰满</td>\n<td>中低</td>\n<td>1.5–4.0 s</td>\n<td>管弦乐/氛围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Plate</td>\n<td>明亮、密集</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n<td>0.5–3.0 s</td>\n<td>人声/打击乐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Spring</td>\n<td>弹性、金属感</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>0.3–2.0 s</td>\n<td>吉他/复古</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Non-linear</td>\n<td>反向/门控</td>\n<td>可变</td>\n<td>强制截断</td>\n<td>特效/80s 鼓</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Convolution</td>\n<td>真实空间复刻</td>\n<td>完整</td>\n<td>IR 决定</td>\n<td>电影/真实空间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Algorithmic</td>\n<td>可调性极高</td>\n<td>可调</td>\n<td>无限可调</td>\n<td>创意/混合</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>混响的 Decay Time（RT60）与音乐速度的关系：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>推荐 RT60</mtext><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mn>60</mn><mtext>BPM</mtext></mfrac><mo>⋅</mo><mn>2</mn><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>(秒)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{推荐 RT60} \\leq \\frac{60}{\\text{BPM}} \\cdot 2 \\quad \\text{(秒)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">推荐</span><span class=\"mord\"> RT60</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BPM</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">(</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">秒</span><span class=\"mord\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>120 BPM 的歌曲：RT60 建议不超过 1.0 秒，否则混响尾音会&quot;溢出&quot;到下一拍导致模糊。</p>\n<h2 id=\"声场参考与检查清单\">声场参考与检查清单</h2><p>完成声场构建后，使用以下检查清单验证空间设计的有效性：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>检查项</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>通过标准</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单声道兼容</td>\n<td>折叠为 Mono</td>\n<td>无严重频率消失</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>左右平衡</td>\n<td>相关性表 / 立体声表</td>\n<td>RMS 左右偏差小于 1 dB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深度分层</td>\n<td>静音混响检查</td>\n<td>前后关系清晰</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>极端位置</td>\n<td>Pan 硬左/右的元素</td>\n<td>不感觉&quot;脱离&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>频率维度</td>\n<td>低频在中、高频可宽</td>\n<td>低频 ICC 接近 1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>小音箱兼容</td>\n<td>笔记本/手机回放</td>\n<td>主要元素仍可闻</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>空间设计质量</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>三维清晰度</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>兼容性</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>风格一致性</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{空间设计质量} = \\text{三维清晰度} \\times \\text{兼容性} \\times \\text{风格一致性}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">空间设计质量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">三维清晰度</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">兼容性</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">风格一致性</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;混音完成&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Mono 折叠测试&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;小音箱测试&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;左右平衡检查&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;深度层次评估&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F{&quot;全部通过?&quot;}&#10;    F --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| G[&quot;声场设计完成&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| H[&quot;返回调整&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; A\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"混音完成\"] --&gt; B[\"Mono 折叠测试\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"小音箱测试\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"左右平衡检查\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"深度层次评估\"]\n    E --&gt; F{\"全部通过?\"}\n    F --&gt;|\"是\"| G[\"声场设计完成\"]\n    F --&gt;|\"否\"| H[\"返回调整\"]\n    H --&gt; A</pre><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>声场三维：宽度（Pan、M/S、立体声展宽）、深度（混响、电平、高频衰减）、高度（频率分布）——高度是频率-空间映射的利用而非真正仰角。</li>\n<li>宽度控制以 Pan 布局为基础，M/S 编码可调 S 增益增宽；所有仅存在于 S 通道的内容会在单声道折叠时消失，故必须做单声道兼容检查。</li>\n<li>深度依赖距离线索（电平、高频损失、D/R 比、早期反射、瞬态软化），D/R 比是最有效的工具，Pre-delay 决定空间大小。</li>\n<li>混响类型（Room/Chamber/Hall/Plate/Spring/Convolution）定义空间性格，RT60 应与歌曲速度对齐以防尾音溢出到下一拍。</li>\n<li>完成声场后用检查清单验证：单声道兼容、左右平衡、深度分层、小音箱兼容缺一不可。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../mix-aesthetics/depth-layers\">深度层次与前后定位技术</a>：本篇深度维度的 D/R 比与 Pre-delay，在该篇展开为多混响层与自动化深度运动。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../signal-flow/bus-routing\">总线路由与混音架构设计</a>：本篇共享混响营造统一空间感，依赖该篇的 Aux Send/Return 总线结构。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../audio-signal-processing/spatial-audio/stereo-principles\">立体声原理</a>（音频信号处理）：本篇 M/S 编码与单声道折叠的数学，在此从立体声信号处理角度完整推导。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../recording-acoustics/capture-equipment/stereo-techniques\">立体声拾音技术</a>（录音与声学）：混音的宽度建立在录音端立体声拾音之上，Haas 延迟与相关性在此有声学来源。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"声场三维构建与空间定位","id":"声场三维构建与空间定位"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"混音空间的三个维度","id":"混音空间的三个维度"},{"level":2,"text":"宽度控制技术","id":"宽度控制技术"},{"level":2,"text":"深度层次的创建","id":"深度层次的创建"},{"level":2,"text":"混响选择与空间设计","id":"混响选择与空间设计"},{"level":2,"text":"声场参考与检查清单","id":"声场参考与检查清单"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"}],"prev":{"title":"并行压缩与多频段动态处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/mixing-engineering/dynamics-processing/parallel-multiband"},"next":{"title":"深度层次与前后定位技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/mixing-engineering/mix-aesthetics/depth-layers"}}